                    coach_r1_frontdoor:     `<strong>That's the portfolio frame the provost is asking for.</strong> A brand-building front door feeds your corporate relationships and the full-MBA pipeline — the Mini-MBA does a strategic job, not just substitutes one product for a cheaper one. Now name the advantage LearnLadder can't copy and the whole plan has a spine.`,
